html[data-skin] [data-you-friends-sent] .fr-row .fr-t a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

/* EDIT PROFILE (features/profile/profile-edit-sheet.tsx; the tour's s50). The
   product's own dialog, dressed: its title, group labels, groups and Save
   wear the kit's (frontend/looks/looks.json), and the rules here give what
   is inside a group the kit's ink, hairline, accent and pill. Nothing is
