/* THE SIGN-IN SHEET (features/auth/sign-in-sheet.tsx, the tour's o04 to
   o06) is the product's own: every step it has, and where it stands (from
   the bottom on a phone, centred from 768px). Under a look it is drawn
   with the kit's sheet: the look's ground and shadow, the sheet's title,
   the kit's field, and the look's button (looks.json "wear"). */
/* The sheet is the landing screen's own child, and the screen is a layer
   under the guest's bar (40 under 41): its dimming stopped at the bar,
   which stayed lit over a greyed page. While a sheet is up its screen is
   the upper layer, so the dimming covers the bar as the standard look's
   covers its header. */
html[data-frame-chrome="guest"] #auth-landing-screen:has([data-sign-in-sheet]) { z-index: 42; }
